      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While feelings of despair and loss of identity are deeply painful, they are only symptoms of grief, not proof that your existence has no value. Many people find that the past versions of themselves can coexist with a new, evolving \"me\" rather than being erased entirely. Please consider speaking with a crisis helpline or trusted individual immediately; even if everything feels hollow, a moment of connection could help you find a new purpose rather than feeling forced to pretend there is one.",
      "source": "target",
